  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>基岩增强模组&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>添加了一种新的基岩变种，可与下界合金盔甲合成。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>不纯基岩方块可在世界最低层生成，范围从 -58 到 -64 层。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>冶炼该方块可获得不纯基岩碎料。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>使用该碎料可合成不纯基岩锭。</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4XQg4DM.png\" alt=\"不纯基岩碎料\" width=\"262\" height=\"135\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>使用该锭可与下界合金工具和盔甲合成以提升装备，例如：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GOzRhKj.png\" alt=\"合成配方 \" width=\"337\" height=\"133\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>效果：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>穿戴全套不纯基岩盔甲将获得强化效果：无限抗性，仅在全套穿戴时生效。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分翻译由自动生成！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RJPr4Ij.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></span></p>",
